          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Jake White names four uncapped players for Fiji's Japan Test",
          "body": "Jake White has named his first Fiji squad for Saturday's Test against Japan, according to Planet Rugby, and it includes four uncapped players. Nacani Boginisoko and Aporosa Vuniyayawa are in the starting XV, while Peni Naruma and Kavekini Boselawa could make their debuts off the bench. It is White's first Test in charge, and it opens preparation for November's Nations Championship matches against France, Ireland and Italy. Japan beat Fiji 20-15 in September's Pacific Nations Cup final, the first time the two have met since."
