          "heading": "Maro Itoje rejects French interest with new Saracens deal, safeguarding England future",
          "body": "Maro Itoje has agreed a new Saracens deal, turning down mooted moves to Perpignan and Bordeaux and committing to a club he first represented in 2013. His existing contract was due to expire after next year's World Cup; the new terms are believed to run until 2029. The extension will let Itoje, who has 102 caps, continue his international career, and he was rested for England's summer Tests against South Africa, Fiji and Argentina after showing signs of fatigue. \"He is staying,\" Brendan Venter said."
