          "heading": "France hit by six major absences before Springboks Test in Paris",
          "body": "Reports ahead of the Springboks Test in Paris put France's absences at six major injuries. AFP's account of the 42-man squad names Julien Marchand, Thibaud Flament, Emmanuel Meafou, Thomas Ramos and Matthieu Jalibert as injured so far this season. The squad was named this week, with flanker Gregory Alldritt back after a year away. Galthié has filled the gaps with uncapped players, including prop Karl Sorin."
