          "kicker": "Centenary Test defeat",
          "heading": "Japan lose 34-28 to Fiji in JRFU centenary Test in Tokyo",
          "body": "Japan lost 34-28 to Fiji in the JRFU 100th Anniversary Match at Chichibunomiya Rugby Stadium, Tokyo, a little over a month after the Brave Blossoms beat the same opponents in the Pacific Nations Cup final. The sides were level at 21-all at half-time, and Fiji's Terio Tamani restored their lead in the 44th minute before Japan levelled at 28-all. Ben Volavola's penalties in the 60th and 69th minutes settled it, according to Fiji Sun's match report. The result avenges Fiji's September Pacific Nations Cup final defeat."
        },
